[%# postfix tries the whole address before the @domain wildcard at the end.  So
    an alias, root, and each account with a mailbox keep their own mail, and
    only an address with none of those goes to the catchall.

    The catchall must be here and not only in virtual_maps.  That map makes
    postfix accept the address, but dovecot gets it over LMTP as written, and
    refuses an address that it has no user for. -%]
[% FOREACH alias IN mail_aliases %]
[% alias.from %]@[% domain %] [% alias.to %]
[%- END %]
[% IF admin_email %]
root@[% domain %] [% admin_email %]
[% END %]
[% FOREACH name IN names.keys().sort() %]
[% name %]@[% domain %] [% name %]@[% domain %]
[%- END %]
catchall@[% domain %] catchall@[% domain %]
@[% domain %] catchall@[% domain %]
